]:ml-auto **:data-[slot=accordion-trigger-icon]:size-4 **:data-[slot=accordion-trigger-icon]:text-muted-foreground">Teks asli<span class="sr-only"> pertanyaan 10</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-chevron-down pointer-events-none shrink-0 group-aria-expanded/accordion-trigger:hidden" data-slot="accordion-trigger-icon"><path d="M6 9l6 6l6 -6"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-chevron-up pointer-events-none hidden shrink-0 group-aria-expanded/accordion-trigger:inline" data-slot="accordion-trigger-icon"><path d="M6 15l6 -6l6 6"></path></svg></button></h3></div></div></div></section></section><section class="_section_818bf0" id="findings" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex items-baseline gap-3 _sectionHeading_818bf0"><span aria-hidden="true">03</span><h2>Analisis Nuave</h2></div><ol class="_items_818bf0"><li class="_card_818bf0"><h3><span class="_ordinal_818bf0" aria-hidden="true">1</span>Temuan fiktif</h3><p>Keterangan perlu dibaca bersama batasannya.</p><div class="_references_818bf0"><span>Berdasarkan pertanyaan:</span><a href="#report-question-1">Pertanyaan 1</a><a href="#report-question-2">Pertanyaan 2</a></div></li></ol><div class="_comparators_818bf0"><h3>Bisnis lain yang disebut</h3><p class="_supporting_818bf0">Daftar ini terbatas pada catatan terstruktur yang tersimpan, bukan seluruh nama dalam jawaban.</p><div class="_comparator_818bf0"><p><strong>Usaha Contoh</strong><span class="_relation_818bf0"> · Disebut dalam jawaban</span></p><div class="_references_818bf0"><span>Berdasarkan pertanyaan:</span><a href="#report-question-1">Pertanyaan 1</a><a href="#report-question-2">Pertanyaan 2</a></div></div></div></section><section class="_section_818bf0" id="priorities" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex items-baseline gap-3 _sectionHeading_818bf0"><span aria-hidden="true">04</span><h2>Yang dapat dilakukan</h2></div><ol class="_items_818bf0"><li value="1" class="_card_818bf0"><p class="_eyebrow_818bf0 _timing_818bf0" data-timing="do_first">Kerjakan dulu</p><h3>Periksa keterangan contoh.</h3><dl class="_actionDetails_818bf0"><div><dt>Mengapa</dt><dd>Ada batasan yang harus diperiksa.</dd></div><div><dt>Berdasarkan</dt><dd>Dua jawaban contoh menyertakan batasan.</dd></div><div><dt>Penanggung jawab yang disarankan</dt><dd>Pemilik bisnis</dd></div><div><dt>Selesai ketika</dt><dd>Keterangan telah diperiksa.</dd></div></dl><p class="_supporting_818bf0 _caveat_818bf0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-info-circle " aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 18 0a9 9 0 0 0 -18 0"></path><path d="M12 9h.01"></path><path d="M11 12h1v4h1"></path></svg><span>Bukan diagnosis penyebab.</span></p><div class="_references_818bf0"><span>Berdasarkan pertanyaan:</span><a href="#report-question-1">Pertanyaan 1</a><a href="#report-question-2">Pertanyaan 2</a></div></li></ol></section><section class="_section_818bf0" id="method" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex items-baseline gap-3 _sectionHeading_818bf0"><span aria-hidden="true">05</span><h2>Tentang audit ini</h2></div><p>We tested 10 questions one at a time through synthetic-local-fixture - fictional-answer-0, fictional-answer-1 without web search. 10 questions did not name the business in the question. 0 questions named the business. 10 of 10 questions completed. A mention is not a recommendation, and a failed test is not a negative result.</p><p class="_supporting_818bf0">Laporan dibuat: <time datetime="2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z">23 September 2026 pukul 00.00.00 UTC</time>. Waktu dan model setiap pengamatan tercantum bersama jawabannya.</p><ul class="_method_818bf0"><li>Ekspor bukti menyimpan pertanyaan, jawaban lengkap, sumber, waktu, model, dan hasil dari laporan yang sama.</li><li>Jawaban dari API tidak mewakili seluruh aplikasi atau percakapan model AI.</li><li>Laporan ini tidak membuktikan penyebab hasil, kualitas layanan bisnis, atau menjamin rekomendasi pada masa depan.</li></ul></section></div><div class="grid gap-2.5 pt-4 text-center _noPrint_f4ef60"><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-slot="button" class="group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-transparent bg-clip-padding whitespace-nowrap outline-none select-none max-sm:min-h-11 focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 disabled:pointer-events-none aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 rounded-button bg-ink-900 text-white transition-[background-color,transform,opacity] duration-150 ease-(--motion-ease-standard) hover:bg-ink-800 active:not-aria-[haspopup]:translate-y-0 active:scale-[0.97] disabled:bg-line-200 disabled:text-ink-400 disabled:opacity-100 h-14 gap-2 px-6 text-lg font-semibold [&amp;_svg:not([class*='size-'])]:size-5 w-full">Download PDF</button><button type="button" tabindex="0" data-slot="button" class="group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border border-transparent bg-clip-padding whitespace-nowrap outline-none select-none max-sm:min-h-11 focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 rounded-md text-ink-900 underline decoration-1 underline-offset-4 transition-[color,transform] duration-150 hover:text-ink-700 active:not-aria-[haspopup]